OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 13, seriously injured in town
OL,4,Acentre stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old boy has been seriously
OL,7,Finjured in a stabbing in a town centre.
OL,9,FGreater Manchester Police said officers
OL,10,Fwere called to Riverside Walk,
OL,11,FRochdale, at 18:09 BST on Saturday.
OL,13,FTwo teenage boys were arrested on
OL,14,Fsuspicion of assault and possession of
OL,15,Fa bladed article.
OL,17,FThe force said the injured teenager was
OL,18,Fbeing treated in hospital and inquiries
OL,19,Fare continuing.
